{"data":[{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:34:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109925700232954187"],"id":"2109925700232954187","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":156,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109899588488577067","type":"quoted"}],"text":"I cover 95% of the good ones (including all the big clubs and/or newly famous clubs).\n\nThere are many more like me.\n\nYou just have to be precise in your schedule, know your route, be prepared to walk 15-25km everyday, and have a lot of patience. https://t.co/u6FfNNXAmp","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109925700232954187"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:01:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109917337239556442"],"id":"2109917337239556442","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":294,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109908193166119009","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Durga Puja is the only public art festival in the world that is shown for free.\n\nSo, if there is a paid preview programme, I fully support it.\n\nHowever, the entire amount should go only to the artist, his team &amp; his labourers; not the club or its members. https://t.co/5DJCa1fEOa","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109917337239556442"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:04:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109903048978100541"],"id":"2109903048978100541","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":803,"like_count":39,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":4},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109678192474939723","type":"quoted"}],"text":"There is a severe lack of interest by the public in this year's Durga Puja, owing to the veg fear, Sanatan imposition, and so on.\n\nConsequently, the investors are also reluctant despite government's assurance, leading to such empty bamboo scaffolding.\n\nIt is heartbreaking to see. https://t.co/kkvViNJRNA","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109903048978100541"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:33:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109880255108301277"],"id":"2109880255108301277","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":357,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I see that a lot of people ask me about Durga Puja in the replies.\n\nIf you've any queries about routes, DM me.\n\nAnd if you want to visit any particular pandal, Google Maps is your best friend. It'll never disappoint you.","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109880255108301277"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109872638873190401","3_2109872655088443392","3_2109872666345910272","3_2109872679453089792"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:03:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109872690597433736"],"id":"2109872690597433736","in_reply_to_user_id":"4764615733","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":308,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109872626764259576","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"📍 Kolkata Sanatani Sangha (Allen Park).\n\n🎨 Subrata Banerjee, Narendra Modi, Amit Shah &amp; Suvendu Adhikari.\n\n👉 The pandal has a 3D laser show going on. Shiva's face is basically animated. There's also Aghori Nritya going on just beside the pandal!\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 2/2 https://t.co/Blc8DTRRYG","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109872690597433736"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109872578605260800","3_2109872591590887424","3_2109872602676416512","3_2109872616681213952"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:03:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109872626764259576"],"id":"2109872626764259576","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":21,"impression_count":3058,"like_count":111,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":10},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108533573976506750","type":"quoted"}],"text":"📍 Kolkata Sanatani Sangha (Allen Park, Park Street).\n\n🎨 Subrata Banerjee, Narendra Modi, Amit Shah &amp; Suvendu Adhikari.\n\n🌟 The theme is Shiva's Tandav.\n\n👉 For a first attempt, this gets a 10/10. The Maa Durga idol is GORGEOUS!\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 1/2 https://t.co/Je0XaObe3k https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109872626764259576"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109676164633772032","3_2109676289355640832","3_2109676519568343040","3_2109676552518762496"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-12T16:04:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109676575524598226"],"id":"2109676575524598226","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":2578,"like_count":94,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":11},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108533573976506750","type":"quoted"}],"text":"📍 New Town Sarbojanin.\n\n🎨 Rintu Das, RSS &amp; BJP.\n\n🌟 The theme celebrates the significance of 'lotus' in Hinduism.\n\n👉 With the regime change, New Town Sarbojanin are doing traditional Durga Puja for the first time. I really loved the pandal, but not the idol.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/HtC6jOrYAq https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109676575524598226"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109611210719264768","3_2109611226699603968","3_2109611240129695744","3_2109611255766155264"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-12T11:44:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109611268080582871"],"id":"2109611268080582871","in_reply_to_user_id":"4764615733","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":79,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109611197150716381","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"📍 Alipore Sarbojanin.\n\n🎨 Anirban Das.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 3/3 https://t.co/4NRgQCrAmN","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109611268080582871"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109611117840596993","3_2109611140473098240","3_2109611162107273216","3_2109611182474895360"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-12T11:44:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109611197150716381"],"id":"2109611197150716381","in_reply_to_user_id":"4764615733","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":240,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109611106532724789","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"📍 Alipore Sarbojanin.\n\n🎨 Anirban Das.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 2/3 https://t.co/g3CwA35sCh","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109611197150716381"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109611040292179968","3_2109611059174883328","3_2109611076652544000","3_2109611091894620160"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-12T11:44:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109611106532724789"],"id":"2109611106532724789","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":1110,"like_count":62,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":5},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108533573976506750","type":"quoted"}],"text":"📍 Alipore Sarbojanin.\n\n🎨 Anirban Das.\n\n🌟 The theme portrays the epic of Ramayana, through the lens of Rural Bengal.\n\n👉 It looks great, but the experience itself was nothing extraordinary.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 1/3 https://t.co/GF3thanmrK https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109611106532724789"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109591722871451648","3_2109591735177506816"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-12T10:27:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109591744501452838"],"id":"2109591744501452838","in_reply_to_user_id":"4764615733","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":127,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109591715275575775","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"📍 Chetla Agrani.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 3/3 https://t.co/Whc3JTrBcN","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109591744501452838"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109591658794979328","3_2109591672279707649","3_2109591684585840640","3_2109591701723754496"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-12T10:27:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109591715275575775"],"id":"2109591715275575775","in_reply_to_user_id":"4764615733","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":270,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109591649815007260","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"📍 Chetla Agrani.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 2/3 https://t.co/6qyoX6t7ef","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109591715275575775"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109591596635488256","3_2109591610971537409","3_2109591624389136385","3_2109591638221946880"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-12T10:26:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109591649815007260"],"id":"2109591649815007260","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":1899,"like_count":73,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":5},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108533573976506750","type":"quoted"}],"text":"📍 Chetla Agrani.\n\n🎨 N/A.\n\n🌟 N/A.\n\n👉 The pandal looks pretty good, but nothing extraordinary for their usual standards.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 1/3 https://t.co/7hTe87NptF https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109591649815007260"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-12T09:05:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109571038845796849"],"id":"2109571038845796849","in_reply_to_user_id":"826717009933012992","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":32,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109569949996081575","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@DevF1ceManAD Yes, Adani Preview Pass and content creator access to few pujas, also Forum for Durgotsob VIP pass","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109571038845796849"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109566514525569024","3_2109566531156000768"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-12T08:47:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109566542891671637"],"id":"2109566542891671637","in_reply_to_user_id":"4764615733","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":182,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109566506149552135","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"📍 Santosh Mitra Square.\n\n🎨 Shib Shankar Das, Narendra Modi, Amit Shah &amp; Sajal Ghosh.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 3/3 https://t.co/NUfwcTpc9J","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109566542891671637"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109566450742784000","3_2109566464021925888","3_2109566478513250305","3_2109566494728507392"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-12T08:47:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109566506149552135"],"id":"2109566506149552135","in_reply_to_user_id":"4764615733","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":322,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109566442769461704","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"📍 Santosh Mitra Square.\n\n🎨 Shib Shankar Das, Narendra Modi, Amit Shah &amp; Sajal Ghosh.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 2/3 https://t.co/fZHHmCqwr4","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109566506149552135"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109566365879439360","3_2109566398607572992","3_2109566417515536384","3_2109566430136107008"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-12T08:46:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109566442769461704"],"id":"2109566442769461704","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":1258,"like_count":41,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108533573976506750","type":"quoted"}],"text":"📍 Santosh Mitra Square.\n\n🎨 Shib Shankar Das, Narendra Modi, Amit Shah &amp; Sajal Ghosh.\n\n🌟 The theme is Vande Mataram.\n\n👉 The pandal looks good, but it can't beat the 2022 one.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 1/3 https://t.co/m07HV2l2O4 https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109566442769461704"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109541627866046464","3_2109541643959611392","3_2109541656513150976"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-12T07:08:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109541667170848837"],"id":"2109541667170848837","in_reply_to_user_id":"4764615733","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":244,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109541619070599222","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"📍 Nalin Sarkar Street Sarbojanin.\n\n🎨 Sanatan Dinda.\n\n👉 The pandal was fantastic too. But, oh boy, I bet that it's gonna be as iconic as 2011 &amp; 2025 works of Sanatan Dinda at this club! Take a bow, Sanatan Dinda!\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 2/2 https://t.co/GJTFcaDxwy","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109541667170848837"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109541556541857793","3_2109541571574292480","3_2109541591484694528","3_2109541606890328064"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-12T07:08:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109541619070599222"],"id":"2109541619070599222","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":1410,"like_count":86,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":8},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108533573976506750","type":"quoted"}],"text":"📍 Nalin Sarkar Street Sarbojanin.\n\n🎨 Sanatan Dinda.\n\n🌟 The theme depicts the significance of water bodies in our life, and our deliberate attempt to not recognise its significance — leading to more water pollution.\n\n👉 THE MAA DURGA IDOL IS STUNNING!\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 1/2 https://t.co/jxy1HxFhiK https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109541619070599222"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-12T03:40:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109489356788658376"],"id":"2109489356788658376","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":1118,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109333744293466537","type":"quoted"}],"text":"If we judge by past, then BJP (under ABV) was as good as Congress (under Rao &amp; MMS).\n\nBut that's foolish.\n\nAt present, this Modi govt. is the worst one since Indira Gandhi. And, Rahul Gandhi, being the pappu he is, doesn't give us any confidence either.\n\nSad state of India. https://t.co/DG27exNKZU","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109489356788658376"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109390231782957056","3_2109390243292176384","3_2109390254453268480","3_2109390267132608512"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-11T21:06:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109390276586549672"],"id":"2109390276586549672","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":610,"like_count":30,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108533573976506750","type":"quoted"}],"text":"📍 Rajdanga Amra Kojon Kalyan Samity.\n\n🎨 Purnendu Dey.\n\n🌟 The theme pays tribute to Gaganendranath Thakur — \n\n👉 This was a decent artwork. But, it was neither too mesmerizing, nor too intriguing.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/iC5sjnCQ6T https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109390276586549672"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-11T10:47:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109234337027596533"],"id":"2109234337027596533","in_reply_to_user_id":"1467179890143232003","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":43,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109219498469232764","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Forum4Durgotsab @bumbaroy06 Did","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109234337027596533"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-11T10:39:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109232372034175203"],"id":"2109232372034175203","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":1000,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Durga Puja 2026 belongs to the legend, Susanta Shibani Paul.\n\nTala Prattoy, Chorebagan Sarbojanin, Ballygunge Cultural Association &amp; Santoshpur Avenue South.\n\nFour artworks. Four phenomenal job.\n\nTake a bow, king!","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109232372034175203"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109156544105570304"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-11T05:38:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109156553127235726"],"id":"2109156553127235726","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":9568,"like_count":54,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":11},"text":"There is a false propaganda being spread, that “the Durga Puja pandals used to be inaugurated before Mahalaya.”\n\nIt's a FALSE allegation, and let me counter that.\n\nBJP are the biggest threat to Hinduism &amp; Kolkata's rich culture. Don't fall prey to their evil tactics! https://t.co/U473lLemQv","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109156553127235726"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-11T04:47:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109143917904232627"],"id":"2109143917904232627","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":5613,"like_count":63,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":7},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109130405903499604","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Hindu sentiments only get hurt when it's the Muslims.\n\nHowever, the biggest threat to Hinduism are the Hindus of North India &amp; Gujarat. https://t.co/CSLqLY1Xxy","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109143917904232627"}],"includes":{"media":[{"height":1972,"media_key":"3_2109872638873190401","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUfF_IlaQAEWl2G.jpg","width":3916},{"height":3188,"media_key":"3_2109872655088443392","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUfGAE_bYAAyKJ5.jpg","width":2160},{"height":2260,"media_key":"3_2109872666345910272","type":"photo","url":"https: